@Ecommerce_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5272

GET {{Ecommerce_Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Consulta principal para Apidog (Development Demo o PostgreSQL)
GET {{Ecommerce_Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/catalog/products?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Contrato OpenAPI (Development)
GET {{Ecommerce_Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
